{
 "_doc": "Heracles (GAME_DESIGN.md: Heroes; owner-approved style test 10/31/2026). Pixel art as rows of letters, 1 letter = 1 pixel, drawn facing right; the game mirrors it to face left. '.' is transparent; every other letter is a colour from palette. Frames: idle, and walk (played in turn while moving). anchor is the pixel at the Hero's feet centre (placed on the Hero's position). Iconography from Greek art and Pseudo-Apollodorus: the Nemean lion's skin worn as a hood and cloak, paws knotted on the chest, a beard, a chiton, and the club.",
